This experiment modifies the implementation as follows:
  - independent teacher-supervised lesion readers with detached decision gates;
  - lesion-conditioned SSM write increments, preserving dt and D*u skip;
  - explicit RGB-FOV masking and identity transitions at invalid positions;
  - one shared core across four raster routes;
  - a decision branch after the frozen RETFound suffix, with one zero-start
    scalar readout and the historical B0 generic branch retained;
  - a pure-PyTorch Conv1d and FP32 associative affine-prefix backend;
  - spatial, constant-mass, generic and valid-site state-reset controls.

The affine-prefix recurrence is adapted from this project's prior V24 local
reference (retina/scripts/v24_mamba_adapter/recurrence.py). No upstream CUDA
kernel or fused inference implementation is copied into this new module.

